Package: luci-app-bitsfilemanager
Version: 1.3.0
Depends: luci-base, rpcd, rpcd-mod-file, cgi-io, libc
Section: luci
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Banten IT Solutions <support@bits.co.id>
License: Apache-2.0
Description: BITS File Manager
  Native file manager for LuCI (no PHP, no Go). Browse, upload, download,
  edit, rename, move, search and delete files on the router.
